:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[The 4th Angel (Enemy)|The 4th Angel]].''
'''The 4th Angel''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]] and can be unlocked during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 548
|rarity = UR
|name1 = The 4th Angel
|name2 = 4th Angel Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''4th Angel Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit's main strength is the long range and good survivability, at least for a unit with its range, and the nice ability against Darks. This unit can provide decent support from the backlines and, sometimes, cause a lot of trouble to Dark enemies by pushing them back rather often, while the occasional Mini-Waves can keep most Dark enemies at bay, although this is usually redundant thanks to most Dark enemies' high knockback count.

Unfortunately, its anti-Dark niche and range come at the cost of a low DPS, even for range of its caliber, making its general usage limited.

{{Job|Classification = Super-Backliner}}

